            "body": "> Can you make it so that simple pattern-string-defined textobjects can also take the linewise option?\r\n\r\nMost certainly won't happen. It is possible to make them linewise by using `V` for visual selection and `V` after common operators (like `dV`, `yV`, etc.).",
